exports[`the scheduler's decisions, per club shape (must not change in A1) > computeDuePosts: sutton 1`] = `
{
  "2026-11-02T09:05:00.000Z": [
    {
      "key": "org-org-sutton:bot-intro",
      "kind": "group-message",
      "text": "👋 Hi all, MatchTime bot is live for this group.

Here's what I do:

🗓  *Attendance*: Say "IN" / "OUT" here (or on the app) and I log you in/out. I react with ✅ to confirm, no extra messages from me.

🗒  *Daily reminders*: Every day at 5pm while the squad isn't full, I'll repost the IN list so we all see how many we need.

🔁  *Bench promotion*: If someone drops, I tag the bench here and the first to reply *IN* takes the slot. No timeout, and nobody loses their place for missing it.

⚽  *Teams*: Tag me and ask for the teams in your own words (for example "@Match Time generate the teams") and I post auto-balanced sides. Objections? Tell me what to change the same way (for example "@Match Time swap Sam with Alex") and an admin will apply it.

🏆  *Ratings & MoM*: I DM everyone a rating link after each match (no sign-up, just tap); pick Man of the Match on your rating link, winner announced in the group once everyone's voted (or 5 days after the match at the latest).

⏰  *Reminders*: Tag me and say when, in your own words (for example "@Match Time remind me Monday"), and I'll DM you then.

📊  *Stats*: Tag me and ask things like "@Match Time who got MoM last week?" or "@Match Time who's our most consistent player?"

Questions? Tag me here, for example *@Match Time help*. Let's go.",
    },
  ],
